docker inspect --format '{{.GraphDriver.Data.MergedDir}}' <container_id>
```

### Key JSON Paths
| Path | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `.HostConfig.Privileged` | Privileged mode status |
| `.HostConfig.CapAdd` | Added capabilities |
