- JSON report listing forwarding rules, delegation changes, OAuth grants, and suspicious audit events with risk scores
- Timeline of compromise indicators with affected mailboxes$S$, '{"db_read","http_get","python_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"cloud-security","tags":["Code","Analysis","Research","Security","Compliance","Cloud"],"files":1}$S$::jsonb, true)
