## YARA Rules for PDF Malware

### Example Rule
```yara
rule PDF_Suspicious {
    meta:
        description = "PDF with JavaScript and auto-execution"
    strings:
        $pdf = "%PDF-"
        $js = "/JS" nocase
        $openaction = "/OpenAction"
        $launch = "/Launch"
    condition:
        $pdf at 0 and ($js and $openaction) or $launch
}
```

