JSON report with matched IOCs, decoded Base64 payloads, timeline of suspicious events, MITRE ATT&CK technique mappings, and severity scores.$S$, '{"http_get","security_scan","python_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"threat-hunting","tags":["Code","Analysis","Research","Security","Compliance"],"files":1}$S$::jsonb, true)
