## USN Journal Parsing

### Record Structure (USN_RECORD_V2)

| Offset | Size | Field |
|--------|------|-------|
| 0 | 4 | Record length |
| 4 | 2 | Major version |
| 8 | 8 | MFT reference |
| 16 | 8 | Parent MFT reference |
| 32 | 8 | Timestamp (FILETIME) |
| 40 | 4 | Reason flags |
| 56 | 2 | Filename length |
| 58 | 2 | Filename offset |

### Reason Flags

| Flag | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| `0x100` | FILE_CREATE |
| `0x200` | FILE_DELETE |
| `0x1000` | RENAME_OLD_NAME |
| `0x2000` | RENAME_NEW_NAME |
| `0x80000000` | CLOSE |

